# 基础词 Unit20
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit20核心词汇

{{extreme}}{/ɪkˈstriːm/}}adj. 极端的；极度的}}{{Extreme weather conditions can be dangerous.}}
{{eye}}{/aɪ/}}n. 眼睛；视力}}{{She has beautiful blue eyes.}}
{{face}}{/feɪs/}}n. 脸；表面；v. 面对}}{{We must face the reality of the situation.}}
{{facility}}{/fəˈsɪləti/}}n. 设施；设备}}{{The sports facility includes a gym and swimming pool.}}
{{fact}}{/fækt/}}n. 事实；真相}}{{It is a fact that the earth is round.}}
{{factor}}{/ˈfæktər/}}n. 因素；因子}}{{Hard work is an important factor in achieving success.}}
{{factory}}{/ˈfæktəri/}}n. 工厂}}{{The factory produces electronic components for cars.}}
{{fade}}{/feɪd/}}v. 褪色；逐渐消失}}{{The color of the curtains has faded in the sun.}}
{{fail}}{/feɪl/}}v. 失败；不及格}}{{He failed the driving test three times before passing.}}
{{fair}}{/feər/}}adj. 公平的；n. 博览会；集市}}{{The judge made a fair decision on the case.}}
{{faith}}{/feɪθ/}}n. 信仰；信任}}{{She has great faith in her children's abilities.}}
{{fall}}{/fɔːl/}}v. 落下；n. 秋天；下降}}{{The leaves fall from the trees in autumn.}}
{{false}}{/fɔːls/}}adj. 错误的；假的}}{{The statement was proven to be false.}}
{{familiar}}{/fəˈmɪliər/}}adj. 熟悉的；常见的}}{{The song sounds very familiar to me.}}
{{family}}{/ˈfæməli/}}n. 家庭；家族}}{{Family is the most important thing in my life.}}
{{famous}}{/ˈfeɪməs/}}adj. 著名的；出名的}}{{The city is famous for its historical landmarks.}}
{{fan}}{/fæn/}}n. 扇子；粉丝；v. 扇}}{{She is a big fan of classical music.}}
{{fancy}}{/ˈfænsi/}}adj. 精致的；v. 想象；n. 爱好}}{{I don't fancy going out in this weather.}}
{{far}}{/fɑːr/}}adj./adv. 远的（地）}}{{The school is not far from my house.}}
{{farm}}{/fɑːrm/}}n. 农场；v. 务农}}{{They own a large farm in the countryside.}}
{{fascinate}}{/ˈfæsɪneɪt/}}v. 使着迷；使入迷}}{{The documentary fascinated viewers around the world.}}
{{fashion}}{/ˈfæʃn/}}n. 时尚；方式；v. 制造}}{{Paris is considered the fashion capital of the world.}}
{{fast}}{/fɑːst/}}adj. 快的；adv. 快地}}{{The cheetah is the fastest land animal.}}
{{fate}}{/feɪt/}}n. 命运；天数}}{{He believed that fate had brought them together.}}
{{fault}}{/fɔːlt/}}n. 错误；缺点；v. 挑剔}}{{It was not my fault that the project failed.}}
{{favor}}{/ˈfeɪvər/}}n. 恩惠；赞成；v. 支持}}{{Can you do me a favor and pick up my package?}}
{{fear}}{/fɪər/}}n. 恐惧；v. 害怕}}{{Many people fear public speaking more than death.}}
{{feature}}{/ˈfiːtʃər/}}n. 特征；v. 以…为特色}}{{The phone has many impressive features.}}
{{federal}}{/ˈfedərəl/}}adj. 联邦的}}{{The federal government passed a new education law.}}
{{fee}}{/fiː/}}n. 费用；学费}}{{The annual membership fee is $50.}}
{{feed}}{/fiːd/}}v. 喂养；n. 饲料}}{{She feeds the stray cats in her neighborhood.}}
{{feel}}{/fiːl/}}v. 感觉；触摸}}{{I feel much better after a good night's sleep.}}
{{fellow}}{/ˈfeləʊ/}}n. 同伴；家伙；adj. 同伴的}}{{He is a friendly fellow who gets along with everyone.}}
{{female}}{/ˈfiːmeɪl/}}adj. 女性的；n. 女性}}{{The female workforce has grown significantly in recent years.}}
{{fence}}{/fens/}}n. 栅栏；围栏}}{{The garden is surrounded by a white fence.}}
{{festival}}{/ˈfestɪvl/}}n. 节日；音乐节}}{{The Spring Festival is the most important holiday in China.}}
{{fetch}}{/fetʃ/}}v. 取来；拿来}}{{Could you fetch me a glass of water, please?}}
{{fever}}{/ˈfiːvər/}}n. 发烧；热病}}{{The child has a high fever and needs to see a doctor.}}
{{few}}{/fjuː/}}adj. 很少的；pron. 少数}}{{Few people attended the meeting due to the storm.}}
{{field}}{/fiːld/}}n. 田野；领域；场地}}{{He is an expert in the field of artificial intelligence.}}
